Only identifiers, curriculum codes, grade-band/subject/domain metadata,
verification status, relationship types, strengths, and file provenance are
retained. Upstream titles, summaries, evidence criteria, assessment prompts,
and official curriculum prose are not copied into the Middle of Math snapshot.

The upstream project describes an independent, non-official candidate learning
map. Its topic and prerequisite relations are used only for editorial
cross-reference. They do not diagnose an individual learner and do not replace
review against the Korean national curriculum.
